{"subjectId":"dsa-basics","id":"trees","title":"Tree Data Structures","group":"","order":17,"html":"<p>-&gt; Non Linear Data Structure</p>\n<ul>\n<li>node</li>\n<li>child</li>\n<li>root</li>\n<li>leaf</li>\n<li>parent</li>\n<li>subtree</li>\n<li>descendants</li>\n<li>ancestors</li>\n<li>degree</li>\n</ul>\n<section class=\"block\"><h3>Applications</h3>\n<p>-&gt; To represent hierarchical data</p>\n<ul>\n<li>organization structure</li>\n<li>Folder structure</li>\n<li>XML/HTML content (JSON Objects)</li>\n<li>In OOPS : Inheritance</li>\n</ul>\n<p>-&gt; Binary Search Tree</p>\n<p>-&gt; Binary Heap</p>\n<p>-&gt; B and B+ Trees in DBMS</p>\n<p>-&gt; Spanning and shortest path trees in computer networks</p>\n<p>-&gt; Parse Trees, Expression Tree in Compilers</p>\n<h4>Variations</h4>\n<p>-&gt; Trie</p>\n<p>-&gt; Suffix Tree</p>\n<p>-&gt; Binary Index Tree</p>\n<p>-&gt; Segment Tree</p>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Binary Tree</h3>\n<p> 30</p>\n<p> 40 50</p>\n<p> 70 60 80</p>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>class Node:\n  def __init__(self, k):\n    self.key = k\n    self.left = None\n    self.right = None\n\ndef print_tree(root):\n  if root:\n    print(root.key, end = \" \")\n    print_tree(root.left)\n    print_tree(root.right)\n\nroot = Node(30)\nroot.left = Node(40)\nroot.right = Node(50)\nroot.left.left = Node(70)\nroot.left.right = Node(60)\nroot.right.right = Node(80)\n\nprint_tree(root)</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Tree Traversal</h3>\n<p>-&gt; Breadth First (or Level Order)</p>\n<p>-&gt; Depth First</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Inorder</li>\n<li>Preorder</li>\n<li>Postorder</li>\n</ul>\n<p>-&gt; Inorder : Left Root Right</p>\n<p>-&gt; Preorder : Root Left Right</p>\n<p>-&gt; Postorder : Left Right Root</p>\n<h4>Consider Tree</h4>\n<p> 10</p>\n<p> / \\</p>\n<p> 20 30</p>\n<p> / \\ \\</p>\n<p> 40 50 60</p>\n<p> / \\ </p>\n<p> 70 80</p>\n<p>Inorder : 40, 20, 70, 50, 80, 10, 30, 60</p>\n<p>Preorder : 10, 20, 40, 50, 70, 80, 30, 60</p>\n<p>Postorder : 40, 70, 80, 50, 20, 60, 30, 10</p>\n<h4>Considering this Tree</h4>\n<p> 30</p>\n<p> / \\</p>\n<p> 40 50</p>\n<p> / \\ \\</p>\n<p> 70 60 80</p>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Inorder Traversal</h3>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>def inorder(root):\n  if root != None:\n    inorder(root.left)\n    print(root.key, end=\" \")\n    inorder(root.right)\n\ninorder(root)\n\n# Auxiliary Space :  Θ(n)</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Pre Order Traversal</h3>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>def preorder(root):\n  if root != None:\n    print(root.key, end=\" \")\n    preorder(root.left)\n    preorder(root.right)\n\npreorder(root)\n\n# Auxiliary Space :  Θ(n)</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Post Order Traversal</h3>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>def postorder(root):\n  if root != None:\n    postorder(root.left)\n    postorder(root.right)\n    print(root.key, end=\" \")\n\npostorder(root)\n\n# Auxiliary Space :  Θ(n)</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Height of Binary Tree</h3>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Input:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p> 30</p>\n<p> / \\</p>\n<p> 40 50</p>\n<p> / \\ \\</p>\n<p> 70 60 80</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> 3</p>\n</div>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>def height(root):\n  if root == None:\n    return 0\n  else:\n    lth = height(root.left)\n    rth = height(root.right)\n    return max(lth, rth) + 1\n\nheight(root)</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Print Node at distance K</h3>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Input:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p> 30</p>\n<p> / \\</p>\n<p> 40 50</p>\n<p> / \\ \\</p>\n<p> 70 60 80</p>\n<p>K = 2 : O/P : 70 60 80</p>\n<p>K = 1 : O/P : 40 50</p>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>def printKDist(root, k):\n  if root is None:\n    return\n  if k == 0:\n    print(root.key, end=\" \")\n  else:\n    printKDist(root.left, k-1)\n    printKDist(root.right, k-1)\n\nprintKDist(root, 2)\nprint(\"\\n\")\nprintKDist(root, 1)</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Level Order Traversal</h3>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Input:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p> 30</p>\n<p> / \\</p>\n<p> 40 50</p>\n<p> / \\ \\</p>\n<p> 70 60 80</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> 30 -&gt; 40 -&gt; 50 -&gt; 70 -&gt; 60 -&gt; 80<br><strong>Input:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p> 3</p>\n<p> /</p>\n<p> 4</p>\n<p> /</p>\n<p> 5</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> 3 -&gt; 4 -&gt; 5</p>\n</div>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code># Naive Method\n\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef printLevelOrder(root):\n  if root is None:\n    return\n  queue = deque()\n  queue.append(root)\n  while len(queue) &gt; 0:\n    node = queue.popleft()\n    print(node.key, end=\" \")\n    if node.left:\n      queue.append(node.left)\n    if node.right:\n      queue.append(node.right)\n\nprintLevelOrder(root)\n\n# Auxiliary Space : Θ(n)</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>Size of Binary Tree</h3>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Input:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p> 30</p>\n<p> / \\</p>\n<p> 40 50</p>\n<p> / \\ \\</p>\n<p> 70 60 80</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> 6</p>\n</div>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>def TreeSize(root):\n  if root == None:\n    return 0\n  else:\n    return TreeSize(root.left) + TreeSize(root.right) + 1\n\nTreeSize(root)\n\n# Auxiliary Space : Θ(h)</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3>maximum Value in Binary Tree</h3>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Input:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p> 30</p>\n<p> / \\</p>\n<p> 40 50</p>\n<p> / \\ \\</p>\n<p> 70 60 80</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--example\">\n<div class=\"callout-label\"><i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2\"></i> Case Example</div>\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> 80</p>\n</div>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>import math\n\ndef getMax(root):\n  if root == None:\n    return -math.inf\n  else:\n    return max(root.key, getMax(root.left), getMax(root.right))\n\ngetMax(root)\n\n# Auxiliary Space : Θ(h)</code></pre></figure></section>"}